 "answer_verbatim": "**For most DTC brands, Klaviyo is the best all-around choice**—especially if you use Shopify and want AI to improve email and SMS marketing, not just generate copy.\n\nIts main advantage is that it connects customer and purchase data to segmentation and automated flows, such as abandoned-cart, post-purchase, and win-back messages. It also offers AI-assisted campaign creation, predictive analytics, and integrations with a broad ecommerce ecosystem.\n\nIt’s not the best tool for every job: if your main need is **ad creative production** or **paid-media attribution**, a specialized tool may fit better. But as a starting point for a DTC brand’s customer marketing, Klaviyo is a strong default.",
